  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 adds empty document creation, stored section page dimensions and margins, guarded native Word equation editing, and original-byte SVG and still WebP image editing and extraction. It expands comment anchors, fixes comment threading and duplicate header/footer warnings, and parses XML measurements independently of host culture. Package inspection, text editing, and command I/O reuse parsed data and buffers to reduce repeated work and copying.",
